OL,3,AOfficers injured and vehicles damaged
OL,4,Ain Portsmouth small boats protest,
OL,5,Apolice say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government condemned "intimidating
OL,8,Fand thuggish behaviour" at the protest
OL,9,F- Commissioner Donna Jones says while
OL,10,Fcrimes were committed, "hundreds" were
OL,11,Facting lawfully
OL,13,FOne protester in Portsmouth tells the
OL,14,FBBC people are "absolutely fed up" with
OL,15,Fsmall boat arrivals
OL,17,FAnother person who saw the migrants
OL,18,Farrive tells us it was a "very strange
OL,19,Fscene to witness" - while adding some
OL,20,Fprotesters' views made her "genuinely
OL,21,Funsettled"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
